--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Why GPL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This theme is a child of the Dev Base Parent Theme, which bundles and loads
GPLv2+ code (Secure Custom Fields and Admin Site Enhancements). A child
theme is not a derivative work of its parent in every legal reading, but
the two ship and run together as one system, and licensing them
differently would create a conflict with no upside.

This theme bundles no third-party code of its own.
